
(7 adịghị-nkewa-abụọ?) eziokwu: { Mpụta dee: ['7 is an ODD NUMBER'], ahịrị-ọhụrụ. }, ma-ọ-bụghị-ya: { Mpụta dee: ['WRONG!']. }.
(4 nkewa-abụọ?) eziokwu: { Mpụta dee: ['4 is an EVEN NUMBER'], ahịrị-ọhụrụ. }, ma-ọ-bụghị-ya: { Mpụta dee: ['WRONG!']. }.
(5 nkewa-abụọ?) eziokwu: { Mpụta dee: ['WRONG!']. }, ma-ọ-bụghị-ya: { Mpụta dee: ['5 is NOT AN EVEN NUMBER'], ahịrị-ọhụrụ. }.
(6 adịghị-nkewa-abụọ?) eziokwu: { Mpụta dee: ['WRONG!']. }, ma-ọ-bụghị-ya: { Mpụta dee: ['6 is NOT AN ODD NUMBER'], ahịrị-ọhụrụ. }.
